{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "直击斜率：从两点快速算出变化率",
    "goals": [
      "直接掌握过两点求斜率的计算方法",
      "通过“向右与上升”理解斜率代表单位水平距离上的垂直变化量"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "开门见山给出结论，不绕弯子",
        "使用“爬山路”单一贯穿比喻，直观解释垂直变化量除以水平变化量",
        "配合函数图动态展示从第一个点移动到第二个点的过程"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 1,
        "min": 1,
        "max": 3,
        "label": "A点横坐标",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.01
        }
      },
      {
        "as": "number_02",
        "initial": 3,
        "min": 1,
        "max": 5,
        "label": "B点横坐标",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.02
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "调整 A 点的横坐标，观察点在直线上的移动",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "向右拖动滑块使横坐标变大",
          "将 A 点横坐标调整为 3"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "太棒了！两点重合时，水平距离为 0，这时不能直接相除求斜率！",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 3,
          "tolerance": 0.005
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "直接给出斜率数值 3，并通过坐标差与山路比喻说明原因",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "收到，绝不绕弯：过这两点的直线斜率是 3！",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "函数图像",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": 1,
                    "max": 5,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -5,
                    "max": 20,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((3)*(x))-(1)",
                    "label": "y = 3x - 1"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "moving-point",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 2,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "second-point",
                    "x": 3,
                    "y": 8,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.y",
                    "expression": "((3)*(number_01))-(1)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "second-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_02"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "second-point.y",
                    "expression": "((3)*(number_02))-(1)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              }
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{8 - 2}{3 - 1} = \\frac{6}{2} = 3"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "为什么是 3 呢？我们把这条直线想象成一段山路：斜率衡量的就是，你往右平移 1 步，高度到底上升了多少。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "斜率的意义",
                "items": [
                  "斜率 = 垂直变化量 ÷ 水平变化量",
                  "从 (1,2) 到 (3,8)：向右走 2 格，向上升 6 格",
                  "每向右 1 格，高度上升 3 格"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-02"
              }
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "聚焦斜率公式与对应坐标计算"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "从点 (1,2) 走到点 (3,8)，水平方向向右走了 2 格，垂直方向往上升了 6 格。两者一除，6 除以 2 正好等于 3！",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "现在换你试一试：观察画面中的滑块，把 A 点的横坐标调整到 3，看看两点重合时会发生什么。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "过点 (1,2) 和 (3,8) 的直线斜率是 3。直观上，就是每向右走 1 步，高度上升 3 格。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
